{
  "_about": "Maps each of Nigeria's 36 states plus the FCT to geo_zone (the six official geopolitical zones, which PIS uses for price zones) and a default agro_zone (the zone name the Knowledge Base uses in regional_overrides). geo_zone is a standard fact. agro_zone is only a default: agro-ecological zones cross state borders, and a farm can override it. agro_zone is null where the Knowledge Base has no zone-specific rules yet (today only 'Nigeria - Guinea Savanna' and 'Nigeria - Sudan Savanna' exist, in the maize files). Every agro_zone value is UNVERIFIED until an agronomist reviews it. Bauchi, Gombe, Borno and Adamawa are left null on purpose because they straddle zones.",
  "pis_source": "PIS state prices exist for 12 states (data/external/zones_config.json in Agrolinking-Intelligence)",
